  "description": "ASP.NET host for a built TypeScript single-page app — React, Vue, Angular, whichever bundler. `app.UseRaskSpa()` serves the bundler's dist/ with correct MIME types, bundler-aware cache headers, precompressed siblings and a SPA fallback that still 404s a missing asset. Pairs with Rask.Cqrs.Server, which gives the client a typed JSON wire and generates its TypeScript from your C# message records; a client that is not TypeScript is refused at build time rather than served half a guarantee. Depends on nothing else in Rask.",
